</volume><fpage>5046</fpage><lpage>5047</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19351201</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hirao</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohtsuki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujiwara</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Mitsui</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Yokogawa</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Okuni</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakayama</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Takio</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yabuki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kigawa</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>An unnatural base pair for incorporating amino acid analogs into proteins</article-title><source>Nat. Methods</source><year>2006</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>729</fpage><lpage>735</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16929319</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kimoto</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kawai</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Mitsui</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Yokoyama</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hirao</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An unnatural base pair system for efficient PCR amplification and functionalization of DNA molecules</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res.</source><year>2009</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>e14</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19073696</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publicat